        "message": "[release-branch.go1.26] cmd/internal/moddeps: restore tests\n\nBy now PRIVATE-track security fixes involving a vendored/bundled package\nhave been released, and these tests can be made to run again as before.\n\n[git-generate]\nupdatestd -goroot=$(pwd) -branch=internal-branch.go1.26-vendor\nsed -i '' '/h2_bundle.go is bundled out-of-band./d' src/cmd/internal/moddeps/moddeps_test.go\nsed -i '' 's/, \"--exclude=h2_bundle.go\"//' src/cmd/internal/moddeps/moddeps_test.go\n\nChange-Id: Iec28f1f2acb8d715f0781185438457bfc2bf7a83\nReviewed-on: https://go-review.googlesource.com/c/go/+/847387\nLUCI-TryBot-Result: golang-scoped@luci-project-accounts.iam.gserviceaccount.com <golang-scoped@luci-project-accounts.iam.gserviceaccount.com>\nReviewed-by: Nicholas Husin <nsh@golang.org>\nReviewed-by: Nicholas Husin <husin@google.com>\nReviewed-by: Dmitri Shuralyov <dmitshur@google.com>\nAuto-Submit: Dmitri Shuralyov <dmitshur@google.com>",
